sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant M as FeedbackManager
    participant P as Lifecycle policy
    participant S as FeedbackStore

    C->>M: cancel(feedback_id)
    M->>S: get(feedback_id)
    S-->>M: current feedback
    alt already CANCELLED
        M-->>C: current feedback, no change
    else transition not allowed
        M-->>C: FeedbackLifecycleError
    else allowed
        M->>P: check transition policy
        M->>S: update status to CANCELLED
        S-->>M: updated feedback
        M-->>C: updated feedback
    end
